== 7.1

=== 1.

The first and the fifth set are not a lattice: In the first, the lowest two points have no lower bound. In the fifth, the upper three points have no upper bound. As all of the sets are finite, all the lattices are complete.

=== 2.

From the lecture: All finite lattices are complete.

